Vendored model: Vosk small English speech-recognition model
==============================================================

This directory contains a redistributed copy of Alpha Cephei's
vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15, vendored so VoiceLock can run offline,
grammar-constrained challenge-phrase recognition (no runtime network).

