Vendored files
--------------
- vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15/   the model directory, unmodified:
    am/            acoustic model (final.mdl)
    conf/          MFCC + model config
    graph/         decoding graph (Gr.fst, HCLr.fst, disambig_tid.int, phones/)
    ivector/       iVector extractor for speaker/channel normalization
    README         the model's own copyright note (Alpha Cephei, 2020)
- LICENSE          Apache License 2.0 (unmodified upstream text, reused
                    from the same pristine copy already vendored in this
                    repo under models/ecapa/ and models/face_landmarker/)

VoiceLock (F8) loads this model via ``vosk.Model(str(MODEL_PATH))`` and
uses Vosk's grammar-constrained ``KaldiRecognizer`` to check whether a
spoken attempt matches one of a small, known challenge-phrase pool — not
open-vocabulary transcription.

